From: lagunaX campaign
Subject: [PATCH 0012] control: mmid device exclusive prefix-sum (default ON)

Device exclusive scan seeds next[] (drops H2D offsets). Keep early counts
D2H+wait before pack — wait-after-pack regresses pp ~20 t/s.
Golden OK. Formal ~+8.99% vs pin (tip stamp remains fused sigmoid+add +9.09%).
Kill: GGML_SYCL_DISABLE_MMID_DEVICE_SORT=1

--- a/ggml/src/ggml-sycl/ggml-sycl.cpp
+++ b/ggml/src/ggml-sycl/ggml-sycl.cpp
@@
 static void mmid_device_fill_mapping(
         const int32_t * __restrict__ ids, int * __restrict__ next,
         mmid_row_mapping * __restrict__ mapping,
         const int n_ids, const int n_tokens, const int ids_row_stride,
         const int n_as, const sycl::nd_item<1> & item) {
     ...
 }
 
+// Exclusive prefix-sum of expert histogram → next[] row offsets (device, no H2D).
+// n_as is small (Laguna=256); single-thread sequential scan is free vs a host round-trip.
+static void mmid_device_exclusive_scan(
+        const int * __restrict__ counts, int * __restrict__ next,
+        const int n_as, const sycl::nd_item<1> & item) {
+    if (item.get_global_id(0) != 0) {
+        return;
+    }
+    int sum = 0;
+    for (int i = 0; i < n_as; ++i) {
+        next[i] = sum;
+        sum += counts[i];
+    }
+}
+
 // Device path in ggml_sycl_mul_mat_id (ne12>1, use_device_sort):
 // BEFORE:
 //   hist → D2H counts + wait → host exclusive scan → H2D next → fill → pack → GEMMs
 // AFTER:
 //   hist → device exclusive_scan(next) → fill → D2H counts + wait → host offsets
 //        → pack → GEMMs  (pack→GEMM continuous; no H2D next)
 //
 // Hit log: [lx-control-mmid] device counting-sort+prefix n_tokens=... k=... n_experts=...
